          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua tlahh'aá Reubeni nee Gadiwo nee tlaqtá tlahhoó Manasewo giri ateét. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Giri báy, «Kuungá' muruudá' Mose, sagadiyusmoó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, naa báy ugwa qoomesé' nee afor'eé' kuungá' aga iialooesé' baraá tidá' naaqo ooi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slám hhaeehúng iga tawo meeri'iiká qoomaarí sleémeero ay laarí. Ala hara'ayár AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng ana eehadé' ar tsáp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee hamí AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng hhaeehúng gaa waydií haniís ar adoodá' ngira al'axweés. Gimsé' daxta kuungá', ki/é' baraá yaamuuhúng kudá' Mose sagadiyusmoó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ naa haniís kiwa ala', kudaá gayuú da/aáw yaaér Yordaniro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala ló'wa ilakaahareesé' hara'ayár AAKOÓ MUNGÚ nee dabeerós kiwa ooha hhe'esa', tidá' Mose sagadiyusmoó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ nuwa hara'ayín iwa káh, ‹AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng na sla'aak, tidá' i kaahi na tlehhiitaak, hara'ayaarós na oohaak, dirós i naga'ataak, nee sagadiyusaak ar mune sleémeero nee ar qeereemo sleémeero.› » ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua inooín giri tsuúq, iri ya/án niwa watliya' amór maray'ín.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose tlaqtá tlahhoó Manase gaa qaroó aalírí haniís ar yaamaá Bashani. Nee Yoshua tlaqtadár hatlá' gaa aalírí haniís tla/ángw hhaeeín amór bihhaá /uwa yaaér Yordaniro. Daxta qoomár ngiwa ya/aámár i haniís niwa watliya' amór maray'ín, inós gina tsuúq. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Giri báy, «Hám a watlá' ar daqaari'iimár yaariir, tidá' naa haasaáng wa hubé' amór wakuuserhúng wa alé. Muruuwí qasmiisaak nee hhaeehúng, hikwa nee peésa nee sahaábu nee muqslár sirdaa/aten nee muqslár hatlá' nee tlabaá yaariire.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy múk tlahh'aá Reubeni nee oo Gadiwo nee tlaqtadár tlahhoó Manasewo tari paraatliyé' nee tlahh'aá hatlá' awa Israeli dír Shílór wa ale baraá Kana'ani. Tari waátl ay ayaaín kudá' Mose aa dir'íní haniís oo Gileadi, tawa aalir'ín ar adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Mose ngura hara'ayín.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niwa hardihiyé' afaá yaaér Yordani awa /uwa, kitángw yangaariír oo ilahhooa kawa da/aa/an nguri tleehhiyé' afaá yaaeérií ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaangwí iri hardáh baraá iaá tlahhi'iidaá hatlá' awa xoorór Israeli, adór tlahh'aá Reubeni nee Gadiwo nee tlaqtá tlahhoó Manase kitángw yangaariír oo ilahhooa ngura tleehhiyé' dír digmuú yaamaá Kana'ani afaá yaaér Yordani, gayuú yaamaá múk Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaangwí kuwa axaás, xoorór Israeli iri burumburít Shílórí ale as tawa slaqwarár ay amór tlahhi'iidaá gayuú da/aáw.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala xoorór Israeli Finehasi garmoó kaahamusmoó Mungú Eleasari guri ya/áp ay amór tlahh'aá Reubeni nee Gadiwo nee tlaqtá tlahhoó Manase awa yaamaá Gileadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tari alkoné' nee geeraharuusér mibaangw ar tlahh'aá xoorór Israeli. Umuúqo heewo a heé úr baraá tlahhaywose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niwa hardihiyé' dír tlahhi'iidaá Israeli awa yaamaá Gileadi, tlahhoó Reubeni nee oo Gadi nee tlaqtá tlahhoó Manasewo, ngiri bayé', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Alqaati sleémeero ar múk AAKOÓ MUNGÚ i kat, ‹Ahaá gár tlaakw ar adór tí masa tlehhé' dír Munguú Israeli? Kuungá' laarí masa dee/aanuté', AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kway meeré' eeharto, as kitangwhúng oo ilahhooa kawa hanmiisi kuwa tlehhé'. Adoorihe kuungá' aga dee/anuti'iikáhe, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kway meeré' eeharto? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahaá, tlakweemaadá' taa tleehhaán baraá Peorír wa ale naa alení'i? Kuungá' a ga/eera'aakáhe, tam hamí taa hhoohhooesaniiká, nee hám tiqtír pu/i ana qo wa mak ti'imitaniiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahaá waáy, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ eeharto musa male sié'? Asma kuungá' laarí bura sié' eeharto, inós matlo in qa/iit dír xoorór Israeli sleémeero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala bar baraá ayaahunge dabaá tlakw i dayá', Mungú kuwa ilahhooárí hanmisa' baraá ayaahúng wa ale bir ya/aandaaká, qwalaasaré' gayuú ayaarén i waaraahhare' amoorí heémár AAKOÓ MUNGÚ i diri', nee aalirhúng baraá tla/angwrén tiwa sleere'. Ala AAKOÓ MUNGÚ mu siaara' nee atene as kitángw hatlá' oo ilahhooa kuwa tlehhtuú eera' ta kuduú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúrén. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' a insleera'aakáhe adór Akani garmoó Sera ira inkihhimu wasleés baraá muruudá' taa hhoohhooeesi as Mungú, Mungú iri buúhh amór xoorór Israeli sleémeero? Slám tlakweemaadaá Akani aa tleéhh inós kilós ngwa gaasi'iiká.› »",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukduú tlahh'aá Reubeni nee Gadi nee tlaqtadár tlahhoó Manasewo geeraharuuseedár tlahh'aá Israeli ngari bayé', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Munguúduú Aleesleemusmo inós an AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kilós! Munguúduú Aleesleemusmo inós an AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kilós! Inós gár naa tleehhaán ga xuu', nee dirhunge sleeme ngi ooaán, barnaxes atén ana dee/aanutaán, laqaá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ haratlintaaoro una siaán, daqaní ti tsu/e', tam panmo miwa meét. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barnaxes atén kitángw ilahhooár da/a/aangw kawa hanmiisaan una tleehhaán, nee ilahhooár balaango, nee ilahhooár wayduwo, daqaní AAKOÓ MUNGÚ li/aywós ngu bui diréní ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aasla'áy. Ala gár kasa tleehhaán a atén ana xuruutaán as aluuwo alér tlede na/iihúng koorén ngi bayá'aáke, ‹Kuungá' nee AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú múk Israeli a milá? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma AAKOÓ MUNGÚ yaaesír Yordani gana qaás tawa digmuú atén nee kuungaásingaá hhay Reubeni nee hhay Gadi. Daxta kuungá' dirhúng i káhh dír AAKOÓ MUNGUHE.› Gawaá adoorihe na/iihúng na/iirén ngi gee/asliyá', AAKOÓ MUNGÚ nguri mayá' sluufmisuwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As adoorí tari ooaán, kitángw ilahhooa hanmis u tleehhaán, ala u ilahhooár wa da/aanaaká, tam ilahhooár muruú ta tsu/i a gawaadá' wa haniisanaaká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala una tleehhaán as tawa laya tla/ángw atén nee kuungá', nee tla/ángw xwaylarén ar aluú wa hi'iit, adór inooín ir hariná' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ nguwa sagadiyuusiya', ar ilahhooár da/a/aangw nee ilahhooár muruú ta tsu/i nee ilahhooár wayda, as kahhó' na/iihúng koorén mingiwa bayé', ‹Kuungá' dirhúng i káhh dír AAKOÓ MUNGUHE.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atén kawa xuaán geeraawo bar kangwdá' kunga atén báy, laqaá tam kwaa xwaylarén ar hi'iít báy, daqaní atén tari ooaan, ‹Ga/aawaak slaqsaywuú kitángw ilahhooa oo AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, kudá' baabi'iirén naa tleehhiyé', ala kwí ku ilahhooár wa da/aa/anká, tam ku ilahhooár muruú ta tsuú/ wa haniisiiká, ala gár kusa tleéhh a as tawa laya tla/ángw atén nee kuungá'.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 22:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kangwsíng atén tiwa pa/i, oo atén niwa dee/aanutaan, nee niwa warqawaan dír AAKOÓ MUNGUHE, atén kitángw hatlá' oo ilahhooa kawa da/aa/an kuwa tleehhaan laqaá oo ilahhooár bu'uungw, laqaá oo ilahhooár muruú ta tsu/i ta kuduú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúrén, oo baraá heémarósí dirií'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.22.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
